  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ベンガルガキ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%99%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB%E3%82%AC%E3%82%AD",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 107844496,
      "text": "ベンガルガキ (あるいはインドガキ、ナンヨウガキ）は、インド、スリランカ、バングラデシュ、東南アジアを原産地とするカキノキ科の被子植物である。常緑高木である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Diospyros malabarica",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diospyros_malabarica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1363378540,
      "text": "Diospyros malabarica, the gaub tree, Malabar ebony, black-and-white ebony or pale moon ebony, is a species of flowering tree in the family Ebenaceae that is native to the Indian subcontinent and South East Asia."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Diospyros malabarica",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diospyros_malabarica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 173939939,
      "text": "Diospyros malabarica es una especie de árbol perteneciente a la familia Ebenaceae que es nativo del subcontinente indio y el sudeste de Asia."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Culiket",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Culiket",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 28701179,
      "text": "Eboni Malabar atau Pala Bulan adalah sejenis pohon anggota suku eboni-ebonian atau Ebenaceae. Nama lainnya adalah culiket (Sunda), klécå/klégå/kledung (Jawa), kumun/komoi (Melayu), makusi, toyokuku, dan gaub."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "uses": {
      "ja": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ベンガルガキ § 利用",
        "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%99%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB%E3%82%AC%E3%82%AD#%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 107844496,
        "heading": "利用",
        "text": "樹皮、葉、花、果実は、アーユルヴェーダ医学では、薬用として使用されている。未熟な葉や果実は、伝統的に布を黒く染める染料として使用されている。樹木からしみ出した粘着性のある物質は、伝統的にボートの防水加工や接合に使用された。材は、建築や家具の用材として使用される。",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Diospyros malabarica § Uses",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diospyros_malabarica#Uses",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1363378540,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "Both the bark of the tree and the unripe fruit have medicinal uses in Ayurveda. This tree was mentioned as Tinduka by Sanskrit writers.\nUnripe leaves and fruits were traditionally used to dye cloth black.\nThe wood is sometimes used in guitar and high-end furniture manufacturing for its distinctive black striped on off-white to golden beige background appearance. Trade names for timber and wooden products are \"Pale moon ebony\", \"Royal white ebony\" and \"Black and white ebony\".",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "es": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (es): Diospyros malabarica § Usos",
        "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diospyros_malabarica#Usos",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 173939939,
        "heading": "Usos",
        "text": "Tanto la corteza del árbol y la fruta no madura tienen usos medicinales en la medicina Ayurveda. Las hojas inmaduras y los frutos se han usado tradicionalmente para teñir el paño negro. El árbol exuda una sustancia pegajosa utilizada para calafatear y sellar los barcos de la manera tradicional. La fruta verde es rica en taninos y se usa para limpiar redes, cuero, etc",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
